            "notes": "## Powers  \n\n[T.Racer](item_996e13d5-9521-4312-944f-d672f528776b) is easily the best power for Tracer. It makes rotations smoother, helps you grab health packs faster, lets you engage on long-range heroes easier, and gives you better escape options. It's a 42% range increase.\n\n## Items  \n\nThe core is [Compensator](item_2a354f80-610c-4661-9bdd-8960ae1a60b0), [Weapon Grease](item_961ae72f-434f-406b-a89b-ab8efec806bf), and [First Aid Kit](item_0172eaaa-1902-44a3-b989-d12f0f7301da). [First Aid Kit](item_0172eaaa-1902-44a3-b989-d12f0f7301da) is especially strong because Tracer\u2019s low HP pool allows her to heal back to full quickly.  \n\n[Ammo Reserves](item_982d53aa-5ef4-493f-93e7-9e374d0ebf34) is another excellent pickup, particularly against heroes like [Zenyatta](hero_3c4002ee-e694-48ed-9730-70fd48773317) or [Ashe](hero_37b42a2d-a82d-4a22-9df2-4c812c873b54). With it, you can more reliably one-clip or two-clip them, and if you aren\u2019t dying often, it will likely net you slightly more cash in R1.  \n\nAgainst [Mei](hero_36fd67f0-19df-4c50-add9-709cfb147cb0), take [First Aid Kit](item_0172eaaa-1902-44a3-b989-d12f0f7301da). Without it, Mei can one-shot you if she\u2019s running [Compensator](item_2a354f80-610c-4661-9bdd-8960ae1a60b0).",
