            "notes": "## Items  \n\n[Talon Modification Module](item_c0ca1795-a3ea-4dc9-ae17-f34122574b3a) and [Ammo Reserves](item_982d53aa-5ef4-493f-93e7-9e374d0ebf34) are the most important upgrades. [First Aid Kit](item_0172eaaa-1902-44a3-b989-d12f0f7301da) and [Adrenaline Shot](item_ab8eba6a-0bda-4b12-8854-4ba4169b515f) keep you healthy.\n\nIf you have extra cash, keep [Weapon Grease](item_961ae72f-434f-406b-a89b-ab8efec806bf) or add more HP with [Armored Vest](item_358361e2-59be-4c81-b221-8a87f37809e6). With even more cash, consider picking up one of the optional rare items.\n\n[Charged Plating](item_b8ca58e7-6ae2-40ee-8618-fe2f32315295) can be a nice item if you have 1k left.",
