            "notes": "## Powers \n\nAfter [T.Racer](item_996e13d5-9521-4312-944f-d672f528776b) and [Quantum Clip](item_3a108115-ec6e-4b98-8074-1b015cf535f1) powers get quite a bit worse and opinions differ. If you don't like [Foresight](item_f4163ce1-8f80-43ca-85d4-39812084400f), just pick one of the other ones.\n\n## Items\n\nThis round you can buy either [Vanadium Injection](item_57953fbc-11ff-4e92-9928-fc59b7be668f) or one of the other optional epic damage items you prefer. I usually get [Vanadium Injection](item_57953fbc-11ff-4e92-9928-fc59b7be668f) because it just matches so well with Tracer. With it, you get 25% movement speed after blinking, another [Weapon Jammer](item_72386db6-753e-413d-aa2a-f1389842f47f) (10% WP + 10% AS), around 330 HP when active, and 10% Cooldown Reduction. Pulse Bomb is not a bad ult, but in Stadium it\u2019s much worse since enemies are often above 350 HP and there\u2019s usually a [Kiriko](hero_70a0ac5c-2a55-4fab-beeb-2f570886426f)with [Two-Zu](item_80f16d3e-a4c0-4fa8-90b1-a0f033a1a77b).\n\nIf you have enough money, consider upgrading [Talon Modification Module](item_c0ca1795-a3ea-4dc9-ae17-f34122574b3a) or [Pulse Detector](item_79ddef46-8917-4d8f-a123-7ddb589ad3e7) into [El-Sa'ka Suppressor](item_b4298dd9-9b93-461f-a2e0-843402667100). At this stage in the game, the healing might be too hard to kill through without it.\n\nAlso consider swapping [Talon Modification Module](item_c0ca1795-a3ea-4dc9-ae17-f34122574b3a) for [Codebreaker](item_caa96c7e-655f-4d03-9bd9-0f41937fec27) if you see a lot of armor on the enemy team.\n\n[Vital-E-Tee](item_b92e6f1d-3aac-4eec-b027-00c8e1529016) is still good option VS heroes low damage pellets/projectiles or beams.",
