            "created_at": "2025-10-01T00:30:21.280202+00:00",
            "notes": "## Items\n\nIf you still don\u2019t have [Eye of the Spider](item_bbaf01d7-340d-4199-b738-86a98d68fe9b), then definitely pick it up now. Since you\u2019re firing continuous bullets, the 10% bonus damage is very noticeable. If you don't have enough money. then pick one of the other epic items.\n\nGrab [Codebreaker](item_caa96c7e-655f-4d03-9bd9-0f41937fec27) if there are many targets with armor, and [El-Sa'ka Suppressor](item_b4298dd9-9b93-461f-a2e0-843402667100) if healing is preventing you from securing eliminations.",
